# The Hobbes engine ignores its own secrets and artifacts, so the drop-in is
# self-contained — no per-client root .gitignore editing, nothing to forget.

# Python build artifacts
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# The PSI key — never commit (it was historically tracked; rotate if exposed)
tools/.psi-key

# Cycle build intermediates — written to disk during a run, consumed once, then
# inert. raw/ is the machine source (findings.py/baseline.py parse it); the
# *-results.md digests are read once by baseline.py to stamp the scorecard, after
# which baseline.md (A–F) + raw/ hold everything downstream needs. Neither is a
# durable deliverable, so both stay out of git to keep the repo from ballooning.
# The durable record is baseline.md, findings.md, plan.md, diff.md.
scorecards/*/raw/
scorecards/*/*-results.md
